# crbug.com/576702252: Performance optimization for phone bots. Side panel does
# not exist on phones, so SidePanelAndroidBrowserTestBase::SetUp()
# unconditionally skips all tests on phone form factors. Filtering these suites
# on the host avoids launching a separate ChromeBrowserTestsActivity process per
# test just to report GTEST_SKIP().
-SidePanelCoordinatorAndroidBrowserTest.*
-SidePanelRegistryAndroidBrowserTest.*
